Third-party material
--------------------
The mascot bitmaps in Sources/HermesCompanion/Pixel/MascotFrames.swift
(generated by scripts/generate-assets.py) and the app icon AppIcon.png (drawn
by scripts/make-icon.py) both come from the Hermes Gadget SDK's
firmware/core/src/mascot_data.cpp, which is itself generated from
assets/mascot/nous-girl-white-1024.png. That artwork comes from the Hermes Agent
repository, https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, released under the
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research. The mascot is Nous Research's
character and part of their brand; check with Nous Research before using it
outside Hermes-related projects.

The 5x7 pixel font in Sources/HermesCompanion/Pixel/PixelFontGlyphs.swift is
ported from the Hermes Gadget SDK's firmware/core/src/font5x7.cpp,
https://github.com/Adolanium/hermes-gadget-sdk, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Hermes Gadget SDK contributors.

The colours follow the SDK's firmware renderer (firmware/core/src/ui.cpp) and
project site (site/src/styles.css, site/src/home.css), from the same repository
and license.
